	<!-- StoryLine -->
	<string id="ui_StoryLine_title_1"			fontName="Tiki-Surf"		fontSize="50"	html="false"><![CDATA[How it all began...]]></string>
	<string id="ui_StoryLine_1"					fontName="Tiki-Surf"		fontSize="25"	html="false"><![CDATA[It's Halloween eve, and the sun is setting on Bikini Bottom. In the dim light, something ghastly is taking place...the whole town is transforming! Streets are turning into graveyards, sunken pirate ships are popping up all over town, and all the residents of Bikini Bottom are acting very strangely...Madness, you say? Welcome to Inikib Mottob!]]></string>
	<string id="ui_StoryLine_title_2"			fontName="Tiki-Surf"		fontSize="50"	html="false"><![CDATA[The story so far...]]></string>
	<string id="ui_StoryLine_2"					fontName="Tiki-Surf"		fontSize="25"	html="false"><![CDATA[Midnight is fast approaching and unless FrankenBob can figure out who is behind this creepy chaos; Bikini Bottom will be doomed! <br><br>There is no time to lose; FrankenBob must press forward deep into Inikib Mottob and find the culprit!]]></string>
	
